WEBVTT

NOTE Narration captions; field dialogue is not transcribed.

VO01
00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:08.180
Tideglass Baths was built to keep a city's water clean.

VO02
00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:12.620
Its machines never sleep.

VO03
00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:17.900
Last night, it ran a diagnostic on its people...

VO04
00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:20.980
...and found the fault.

VO05
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:31.860
So the company sent the night shift.

VO06
00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:33.680
Qind Qompany.

VO07a
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:39.900
Eight engineers. Every time you deploy, you're dealt one at random.

VO07b
00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:45.100
Make it work.

VO08a
00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:46.620
Each side has a commander.

VO08b
00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:50.980
One holds the light. One grows the dark.

VO09a
00:00:53.100 --> 00:01:00.860
Six command sites. Every base you hold brings power, supply and tech. Every base you lose...

VO09b
00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:02.060
...the Seedweb grows into.

VO10
00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:36.180
Flood channels. Vents. Service tunnels. Every route is a way in.

VO11a
00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:47.260
In the dark, the Creep sense everything that carries power...

VO11b
00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:48.200
...including your flashlight.

VO12
00:01:54.800 --> 00:02:00.080
Nothing on your side heals itself. Your commander decides who gets the medpack.

VO13
00:02:18.100 --> 00:02:20.740
Take their bases. Starve their tech.

VO14
00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:48.980
Hold the light.

VO15
00:02:55.100 --> 00:02:57.420
Qind Qompany: Origin of Species.
